{"id":"n85207-3-7","stage":5,"title":"핑 · 晕眩","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85207-3-7-1","ko":"지수야, 너 괜찮은 거야? 좀 잡아 줄게.","zh":"智秀，你没事吧？我扶着你吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮은","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮은","audio":"/audio/cf1870a0494982c18484.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"잡아","meaning":"抓，揪","explanation":"잡다：抓，揪；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡아","audio":"/audio/cd01e0912f86aeaeb2e9.mp3"}},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄게","audio":"/audio/f81c77e211e7de437a74.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，揪","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"用手握住不放。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/700c1f27b81c55484344.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85207-3-7-2","ko":"응, 고마워. 갑자기 주위가 핑 도는 것 같이 어지럽다.","zh":"嗯，谢谢。突然觉得周围天旋地转，好晕。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고마워","audio":"/audio/e9e8361d4662874097d3.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"주위가","meaning":"四周","explanation":"주위：四周；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주위","audio":"/audio/9776611139b2a008d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66583","senseId":"2","lemma":"주위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주위가","audio":"/audio/9065bf1c73305869f260.mp3"}},{"text":"핑","meaning":"晕眩","explanation":"핑：晕眩","readings":[{"term":"핑","audio":"/audio/a1287ded4209f758ac8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85207","senseId":"3","lemma":"핑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"핑","audio":"/audio/a1287ded4209f758ac8d.mp3"}},{"text":"도는","meaning":"发晕","explanation":"돌다：发晕；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"6","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도는","audio":"/audio/34c5de443adc230177d9.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"어지럽다.","meaning":"晕，晕眩","explanation":"어지럽다：晕，晕眩；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"어지럽다","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14588","senseId":"1","lemma":"어지럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어지럽다","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"9776611139b2a008","term":"주위","zh":"四周","audio":"/audio/9776611139b2a008d05e.mp3","entryId":"66583","definition":"围住某物或某人；或指那样的环境。","pronunciation":["주위"]},{"id":"a1287ded4209f758","term":"핑","zh":"晕眩","audio":"/audio/a1287ded4209f758ac8d.mp3","entryId":"85207","definition":"突然头晕的样子。","pronunciation":["핑"]},{"id":"2dc53ba2c5ff682d","term":"돌다","zh":"发晕","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3","entryId":"75006","definition":"头晕眼花，以至于打不起精神来。","pronunciation":["돌ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"1e2f790342e5cbb6","term":"어지럽다","zh":"晕，晕眩","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3","entryId":"14588","definition":"感觉周围的所有事物都在旋转一般而无法控制身体。","pronunciation":["어지럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f36b454280679ab986d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.316,"source":{"url":"https://krdic